- So you still get a lot of fan mail.

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.390
So here's one that you posted.

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:04.223
- [Taylor Lautner] Oh boy.

00:00:04.223 --> 00:00:05.111
- Let's show this.

00:00:05.111 --> 00:00:05.944
- [Taylor Lautner] Oh.

00:00:05.944 --> 00:00:06.777
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:06.777 --> 00:00:07.610
Oh, yes.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:08.443
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:08.443 --> 00:00:10.170
- First of all, if you're
rockin' that kind of body,

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:11.553
boy, I'd be doin' those photos too.

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:12.690
(Taylor laughing)

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:13.890
Like, that's amazing!

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:16.110
- Here's my favorite
thing about that photo.

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:17.970
I'm not wearing anything-

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:18.803
- Except tennis shoes!

00:00:18.803 --> 00:00:19.636
- But tennis shoes.

00:00:19.636 --> 00:00:20.469
(audience members laughing)

00:00:20.469 --> 00:00:21.302
Like, what? I don't-

00:00:21.302 --> 00:00:23.559
- [Kelly Clarkson] Because you
wanna take care of your feet.

00:00:23.559 --> 00:00:24.392
- [Taylor Lautner] Yeah.

00:00:24.392 --> 00:00:25.225
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:27.773
- [Taylor Lautner] Yeah. I
guess. I guess. Love the shoes.

00:00:27.773 --> 00:00:28.787
- This is amazing!

00:00:28.787 --> 00:00:29.670
- [Taylor Lautner] Great touch.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.460
- Oh my god. That's amazing!

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:33.510
Well, because of streaming,

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:35.760
everybody is starting
to rediscover things.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.380
Like, there were huge pop culture moments.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.213
- [Taylor Lautner] Yeah.

00:00:38.213 --> 00:00:39.450
- And even my seven year
old daughter, literally,

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.010
I found her watching
Twilight which, I love you,

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:42.450
but I had to turn it
off 'cause she's seven.

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:43.283
- Yeah.

00:00:43.283 --> 00:00:44.460
- But I love the movies and she's,

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:45.630
I'll let her watch 'em when she's older,

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:47.190
but it's cool because
you're getting these,

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:48.630
all these new audiences.

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:49.463
- [Taylor Lautner] Yeah.

00:00:49.463 --> 00:00:50.296
- Like, and I think
that's kind of interesting

00:00:50.296 --> 00:00:51.900
and I know that you had to have had

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:53.970
crazy passionate fans back in the day.

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.800
You're probably getting even more now.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.560
What's like a crazy story
from like a fan that happened?

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.020
- They're definitely more chill
now because, like you said,

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.000
it's like, it's like these younger kids

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.040
that are coming up that
are just starting to watch-

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:05.873
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah!

00:01:05.873 --> 00:01:07.920
- Twilight for the first time, but I mean,

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:09.750
back in the day there's, oh my gosh,

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.080
there's a list of just crazy memories and-

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:13.913
- [Kelly Clarkson] I can't imagine.

00:01:13.913 --> 00:01:15.210
- Fan experiences-

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:16.043
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:01:16.043 --> 00:01:17.250
- From, you know, being in Brazil

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:21.390
and having thousands of
fans break into our hotel

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:23.430
and they had to call the
Brazilian National Guard

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:24.263
to get them out.

00:01:24.263 --> 00:01:25.096
- What?

00:01:25.096 --> 00:01:26.370
- These are very passionate fans.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:29.400
I mean, it's why the books
and movies are so successful

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.960
is these fans.

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:32.790
They don't give up.
They get what they want.

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:34.800
- I love the books and movies.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:37.170
I would never break into your hotel room.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:38.158
There are normal fans.

00:01:38.158 --> 00:01:39.060
(Kelly and Taylor laughing)

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:41.400
It's like, there are people
that just appreciate the art.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.233
(Taylor chuckling)

